      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This feature will be quite useful for those who use shaders for special world functions. For example, compute shaders will be able to fire triggers, resulting in the control of non-visual components such as sounds and colliders.\nI personally want to use Texture2D.GetPixel to read data from render textures.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
