      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a pretty big blocker for me. I need to be able to read pixel values from textures for some things I'm building that are currently stalled. Being able to ReadPixels so that I can take a RenderTexture from my camera and copy it to a Texture2D would also be pretty useful for me.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
