      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "`RenderTexture`, `Texture`, `Texture2D`, and `Texture3D` have been exposed since a few months ago now. \nWe are still missing `Sprite`, `Cubemap`, `CubemapArray` and `Texture2DArray`. Due to how Udon names its types, `CubemapArray` and `Texture2DArray` would need special handling to prevent naming conflicts with `Texture2D[]` and `Cubemap[]`, but there shouldn't be any reason that `Sprite` and `Cubemap` would be difficult to expose.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
